Top five on the New Zealand Beach Tour, at a young age, from Hamilton.

Meet Mollie Allison, our 14th ambassador. She represents New Zealand in beach volleyball, coaches players from 5 to adult, and is studying clinical exercise physiology. She tells us about training with few partners, funding it herself, and the goal of playing for New Zealand around the world.

